Hello everyone,

The October performance reviews start next week. As every year, we hold reviews twice a year, in April and in October.

What to do:
- By Friday 16 October, fill in your self-review form in PeopleHub. It takes about 20 minutes.
- Your manager will book a one-hour meeting with you between 19 and 30 October.
- After the meeting, your manager writes a short summary, and you both sign it in PeopleHub.

In the meeting you will look back at the last six months and agree two or three goals for the next six. It is also a good moment to talk about training you would like to do.

Managers, please make sure all meetings are booked by Friday 16 October. If you have questions, write to hr@contoso-water.example.

Kind regards,
Priya
